{"id":"00606","root":"uni00606_1","name":{"ja":"バラライカ","en":"Sofiya Pavlovna"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"バラライカ","en":"Sofiya Pavlovna"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2022-07-31","limited":true,"characterId":351,"profile":{"ja":"世界各地に支部を持つロシアンマフィア「ホテルモスクワ」のロアナプラ支部の女ボス。若き頃、オリンピック射撃種目の選手を目指し、旧ソ連空挺軍に入隊したが、アフガニスタン侵攻に出征させられてしまう。火傷顔（フライフェイス）、全身の火傷跡はその戦線の時に負ったものらしい。主な部下はそのとき共に戦った遊撃隊のメンバーから構成されている。","en":"She is the female boss of the Roanapura branch of the Russian mafia \"Hotel Moskva\", which has branches all over the world. In her youth, she aimed to be an Olympic shooting athlete and joined the former Soviet airborne troops, but was sent to fight in the Afghan invasion. Her burned face and full-body burn scars are said to have been sustained during that time. Her main subordinates are composed of members of the reconnaissance team who fought alongside her back then."},"illustrator":"広江礼威","voiceActor":"小山茉美","forms":[{"id":"uni00606_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[934,1868],"sp":[180,180],"atk":[202,404],"def":[99,198],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","1560008"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00606_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1368,2736],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[339,678],"def":[133,266],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","1560008","1560009"],"evolve":[["evo00008",10],["evo00009",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00606_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[1802,3603],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[481,961],"def":[172,344],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","1560008","1560009","1560010"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメー