: 1 hits of 126% Spiritual damage"},{"text":"Power rises the fewer targets there are"},{"text":"All allies: attack boost 10% for 2 turns","icon":"attackboost"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"フライフェイス"},"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ユニットのATKを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Spiritual allies: ATK +20%","icon":"atk_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00006",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00006",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00006",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00006",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00006",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00006",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00006",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"あなたが隊長さん？　初めまして、私のことは“バラライカ”と呼んでちょうだい。この街で戦争を始めるなら私と私の部隊は役に立つわ","en":"You're the captain? Nice to meet you, call me \"Baralaika\". If you're going to start a war in this town, I and my troops can be of use to you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"私の『ホテル・モスクワ』は立ち塞がる全てを容赦しない。それを排撃し、殲滅する。あなたにそれを仕切る勇気はあって？","en":"My \"Hotel Moskva\" shows no mercy to anyone who gets in our way. We'll eliminate them without hesitation. Do you have the courage to give us those orders?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"私はただの商売人よ。あなたたちと同じく経済活動で利潤を追及する。違うのは、扱うのが『恐怖』と『暴力』ということだけ","en":"I'm just a businesswoman. I pursue profits through economic activities, just like you. The only difference is that I deal in \"fear\" and \"violence\"."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"アサギとはあの砂漠の戦場で出会ったわ。最初に見た時は、何か凄い恰好をしてる……と思ったけれど、実力は申し分なかったわね","en":"I met Asagi on that desert battlefield. At first, I thought she looked quite something, but her skills were undeniable."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"正義という言葉は私も好きよ。掲げるお題目は空虚なほど明るく輝くものだから","en":"I like the word \"justice\" too. The slogan we uphold is bright and empty."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"あなたも指揮官を志すなら覚えておきなさい。いずれその肩は、失った命で取り返しのつかないほど重くなる","en":"If you're going to be a commander, remember this: one day, the weight of the lives you've lost will become unbearable."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"我々は無様な亡者だ。最後の一片の誇りまで奪われ、生者への怒りと妬みで満ちている。せいぜい引きずられぬように心するのだな、隊長殿","en":"We're a miserable bunch, stripped of our last shred of pride, filled with anger and resentment towards the living. All we can do is try not to be dragged down, Captain."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"殺し合い、奪い合うのはこの世の常――それを理解していても、ひどく疲れる時がある。特に、お前たちのような子供の死を見た時には","en":"It's just the way of the world - we kill and take from each other. Even if I understand that, it can be exhausting at times. Especially when I see the death of children like you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00606_1/uni00606_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100,200],"scenes":[["chr_0454_1"],["chr_0454_2"]],"stills":[["chr_0454_1a","chr_0454_1b"],["chr_0454_2a"]],"obtain":[],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00606","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00606_v","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0454"}}